  "id": "https://samsm.ch/subways/",
  "type": "Article",
  "name": "Subways",
  "summary": "\u003cp\u003eThis is the remnants of a failed attempt at a photo project looking at\nBirmingham\u0026rsquo;s pedestrian subways. I never really thought it was a very good idea\nfor a project but I decided to give it a go anyway because I wanted to try\nshooting a project and it was the best idea that I had, also the subways are the\nsort of thing that I usually like to shoot anyway.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8405/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8405/8405.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 1\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8405\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 1\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e",
  "content": "\u003cp\u003eThis is the remnants of a failed attempt at a photo project looking at\nBirmingham\u0026rsquo;s pedestrian subways. I never really thought it was a very good idea\nfor a project but I decided to give it a go anyway because I wanted to try\nshooting a project and it was the best idea that I had, also the subways are the\nsort of thing that I usually like to shoot anyway.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8405/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8405/8405.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 1\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8405\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 1\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eEverything in this series was shot with my Hasselblad 500C/M and Zeiss 60mm\nDistagon CF with Ilford HP5+ rated at 800 and developed with Kodak HC-110 at a\ndilution of 1+49 for 11 minutes. This is what I shoot most of the time anyway\nbut I thought that the pushed HP5+ would work well for the sort of gritty feel\nof the subways. I shot 3 separate rolls of film on 3 different days in May of\n2018. I have chosen 12 of the 23 pictures that I took that I feel fit the scope\nof the project.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8406/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8406/8406.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 2\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8406\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 2\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe intention behind the project was to capture the feeling of the subways,\nwhich I think I was at least partially successful in doing. I think photos 2, 8\nand 9 capture some of the dread and uncertainty I, at least used to, feel when\nentering one of these. At some point when hunting these things down I began to\nrealise how quickly they were disappearing, a couple that I photographed were\nfenced off and one that I visited had been totally filled in. I was then also\ntrying to document some of these before they were also demolished. The main\nthing that I failed to capture was a human aspect of the subways, although I\u0026rsquo;m\nnot sure that photographing people walking through these areas or homeless\npeople sleeping in them would be more compelling than what I have.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8408/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8408/8408.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 3\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8408\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 3\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8704/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8704/8704.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 4\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8704\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 4\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eI gave up on the project mostly just because I\u0026rsquo;d lost interest in it. I visited\nalmost all of the subways that I managed to find, some a few times, and despite\nonly shooting 23 images I was starting to feel like there wasn\u0026rsquo;t really any new\ncompositions left since they\u0026rsquo;re all quite visually similar.\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8705/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8705/8705.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 5\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8705\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 5\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8706/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8706/8706.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 6\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8706\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 6\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8808/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8808/8808.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 7\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8808\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 7\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8810/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8810/8810.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 8\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8810\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 8\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8403/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8403/8403.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 9\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8403\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 9\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8409/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8409/8409.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 10\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8409\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 10\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8707/8707.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 11\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"8707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 11\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003e\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/8712/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/8712/8712.avif\"\n         title=\"Subways 12\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"8712\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\u003cfigcaption\u003e\n            \u003cp\u003eSubways 12\u003c/p\u003e\n        \u003c/figcaption\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/br\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSee also:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.flickr.com/photos/ss9679/sets/72157670945132397\"\u003eFlickr album\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/AnalogCommunity/comments/9jdvur/subways_my_first_attempt_at_a_photography_project/\"\u003eReddit discussion\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e",
